('APX-S-4833-1', 'APX-C-4833', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 566, 'The walking track is extremely long and wide, stretching along the ocean coastline. The track has alternating and white rectangular sections painted on the ground, creating a stylish modern jogging path.', null, null, null, null, 'ocean', null),
('APX-S-4833-2', 'APX-C-4833', 2, null, null, null, 'The atmosphere is peaceful yet energetic. The sky is filled with soft morning clouds while the rising sun slowly appears in the distance, casting golden-orange light across the ocean surface. Birds are flying naturally across the sky near the sunrise. Cool morning wind moves through the scene, making clothes, hair, plants, and ocean water move realistically. Several people are walking and jogging casually on the seaside track. In the center of the scene, a very beautiful athletic young woman is jogging confidently.', null, null, 'The atmosphere is peaceful yet energetic. The sky is filled with soft morning clouds while the rising sun slowly appears in the distance, casting golden-orange light across the ocean surface.', null, null, null, null, 'ocean', 'calm'),
('APX-S-4833-3', 'APX-C-4833', 3, null, null, null, 'She is wearing stylish modern workout clothes suitable for running: a sporty half-sleeve athletic top, fitted running shorts, and white jogger shoes. Her hair moves naturally in the ocean breeze while she runs energetically beside the sea. The camera follows her in cinematic tracking shots as she runs along the track. After running for some time, she suddenly becomes tired and stops near the edge of the track. She bends slightly forward and takes deep breaths while looking toward the ocean.', null, null, 'She is wearing stylish modern workout clothes suitable for running: a sporty half-sleeve athletic top, fitted running shorts, and white jogger shoes. Her hair moves naturally in the ocean breeze while she runs energetically beside the sea.', null, 'sprinting', null, null, 'ocean', null),
('APX-S-4833-4', 'APX-C-4833', 4, null, null, null, 'The sound of heavy breathing mixes with loud crashing sea waves. After a few seconds of resting, she regains energy and starts running again with determination. On the opposite side of the track, there is another section beside the road where two elderly men are sitting on a bench surrounded by beautiful greenery. Small decorative plants are planted near the bench, and behind them are larger lush green plants and bushes with healthy grass covering the ground. The elderly men are watching the young woman jogging.', null, null, 'After a few seconds of resting, she regains energy and starts running again with determination.', null, 'sprinting', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4833-5', 'APX-C-4833', 5, null, null, null, 'Inspired by her energy, they smile, stand up from the bench, and slowly begin jogging behind her in a funny and motivational cinematic moment. Camera shots for the 15-second video: Opening wide drone shot of the ocean walkway and sunrise Slow-motion sea waves splashing high beside the track Tracking shot following the jogging woman Close-up of her shoes hitting the red and white track Medium shot of her stopping and breathing deeply Cut to two old men watching from the bench Funny cinematic moment of the old men starting to jog Final wide shot showing everyone moving along the seaside path with sunrise in the background Environmental details: Loud realistic ocean wave sounds Morning wind ambience Birds chirping and flying overhead Water splashing effects Footstep sounds on the jogging track Soft cinematic motivational background music', null, null, 'Inspired by her energy, they smile, stand up from the bench, and slowly begin jogging behind her in a funny and motivational moment.', null, null, null, null, 'ocean', 'comedic'),
