('APX-S-4799-1', 'APX-C-4799', 1, null, null, null, 'The entire environment is styled in a bold monochrome red aesthetic. Floating ridged chips, chili flakes, and sliced red chilies slowly move in controlled slow-motion around the subject. The camera opens with a soft cinematic push-in shot toward the main subject seated in the center. 👩 Main Subject Action A young woman sits cross-legged in the middle of the red studio: She looks directly into the camera with a soft confident smile She slowly raises a crispy ridged chip toward her lips (slow motion emphasis) In her other hand, she holds a glossy spicy chips packet angled toward the camera Subtle natural movements: blinking, slight head tilt, gentle hair motion from studio wind Confident, relaxed, modern Gen Z snack ambassador vibe 🧥 Wardrobe (Static but Cinematic Movement) White fitted tank top Bright red structured blazer with natural fabric motion Matching red tailored pants Clean white sneakers Gold hoop earrings and thin necklace gently reflecting light 🥔 Product Focus (Hero Shot Moments) Chips packet remains clearly visible throughout Camera briefly racks focus from face → chip → product packet Chips appear ultra-crispy with visible seasoning dust Floating chips rotate slowly in background with spice particles 🎬 Cinematography & Camera Movement Start: Slow dolly-in from medium-wide shot Mid: Soft orbit around subject (slight 15–20° rotation) Close-up: Macro shot of chip texture in hand (slow motion) Product focus: Sharp rack focus on chips packet logo End: Freeze-frame style hero composition 💡 Lighting & Atmosphere Bright premium studio lighting Soft frontal key light for flawless skin Red rim lighting on hair and outfit edges Controlled glossy reflections on packaging Floating spice particles subtly glowing in light beams Soft shadows under subject for grounded realism 🎞️ Final Look Ultra-realistic commercial film quality Smooth slow-motion transitions Crisp product readability High-end snack brand advertisement style Viral Gen Z aesthetic like luxury food fashion campaign', null, null, 'The camera opens with a soft shot toward the main subject seated in the center.', null, null, 'spice', 'incidental', 'studio', 'calm'),
('APX-S-4800-1', 'APX-C-4800', 1, null, null, null, 'Ultra-photorealistic 10-second cinematic IPL broadcast video, starting exactly from the attached reference image as the first frame. A young Indian female MI fan is sitting in the crowded stands during a live IPL night match between Chennai Super Kings and Mumbai Indians. She is wearing a stylish blue Mumbai Indians jersey, looking towards the field with anticipation and a slight smile.', null, null, 'A young Indian female MI fan is sitting in the crowded stands during a live IPL night match between Chennai Super Kings and Mumbai Indians.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4800-2', 'APX-C-4800', 2, null, null, null, 'Suddenly, a powerful batsman hits a massive six. The red cricket ball flies in a high realistic arc directly towards the stands where she is sitting. Dynamic multi-shot sequence: 1. Starting shot: Close-medium broadcast shot on the woman (exactly matching the reference image), shallow depth of field. 2.', null, null, 'The cricket ball flies in a high arc directly towards the stands where she is sitting.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4800-3', 'APX-C-4800', 3, null, null, null, 'Wide shot + camera pans rapidly following the ball''s trajectory as it soars into the crowd. 3. Medium tracking shot back on the woman as she reacts quickly — stands up, stretches both hands, and makes a clean, dramatic catch of the ball. 4. Hero close-up shot of her joyful celebration — big excited smile, holding the ball up proudly, cheering with the crowd going wild around her.', null, null, 'Shot back on the woman as she reacts quickly — stands up, stretches both hands, and makes a clean, dramatic catch of the ball.', null, null, null, null, null, 'playful'),
