('APX-S-4708-1', 'APX-C-4708', 1, null, null, null, 'Ultra-cinematic archaeological discovery sequence inside an ancient abandoned Japanese mountain temple at night, humid air, drifting incense smoke, subtle rain outside the structure. A lone archaeologist slowly walks through the dark temple corridor carrying a weak flashlight and an old lantern. Ancient wooden pillars, faded paper screens, and cracked stone floors disappear into darkness around him.', null, null, 'Ancient wooden pillars, faded paper screens, and cracked stone floors disappear into darkness around him.', null, null, null, null, 'mountain, temple', null),
