('APX-S-4708-4', 'APX-C-4708', 4, null, null, null, 'The archaeologist approaches cautiously, completely mesmerized. His face reflects the glowing energy while particles drift upward unnaturally around the statue. The camera slowly circles around the discovery while the glowing symbols become brighter and ancient dust falls softly from above. Final seconds: the statue’s eyes suddenly illuminate intensely, casting powerful light across the entire chamber while the archaeologist freezes in awe.', null, null, 'His face reflects the glowing energy while particles drift upward unnaturally around the statue. The camera slowly circles around the discovery while the glowing symbols become brighter and ancient dust falls softly from above.', null, null, null, null, null, 'awe'),
