('APX-S-4703-2', 'APX-C-4703', 2, null, null, null, 'The camera follows the girl as she slowly walks through the dark jungle, hearing loud wild animal sounds in the background — distant tiger roars, monkeys screaming, insects buzzing, birds flying suddenly from the trees. The atmosphere feels intense, mysterious, and dangerous. As she moves deeper into the jungle, she suddenly encounters a group of mysterious tribal jungle people standing between the trees.', null, null, 'The camera follows the girl as she slowly walks through the dark jungle, hearing loud wild animal sounds in the background — distant tiger roars, monkeys screaming, insects buzzing, birds flying suddenly from the trees.', null, null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
